{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation interface, separating sensing (uncontrollable events) from motion (controllable events). The specification encodes safe, coverage-biased exploration: forward/random_walk in clear, brief directed turns for side obstacles, cautious backward/turn for front obstacles, and rapid return to exploration after recovery. Only one controllable is enabled per state, and all recovery/commit states are one-shot. All uncontrollable events are total per state.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion to reflect the robot's interface.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, coverage-focused exploration, with conservative but minimal recovery and rapid return to forward progress."
  ],
